<Base
  title="Credit Signal Methodology — FCRA-Clean Soft-Pull Aggregation | LO Radar"
  description="Technical whitepaper: how LO Radar surfaces credit-improvement signals without being a consumer reporting agency. Soft-pull aggregations only; never a hard inquiry."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
